<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Keen Eyes</ansi> mutation

Your eyes develop a crystalline clarity. Perception sharpens
dramatically, though coordination suffers.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi>  Eyes
<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Uncommon

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Moderately improved perception — your crystalline vision catches
  details others miss entirely

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly reduced dexterity — the intense focus on visual detail
  makes fluid movement harder to maintain

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Infrared Vision

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
